meta {
  name: Sync My Cart
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

put {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/carts/mine
  body: json
  auth: inherit
}

body:json {
  {
    "items": [
      {
        "product_id": 1,
        "quantity": 1
      }
    ]
  }
}

docs {
**Access:** Customer (bearer)

**Request body** `SavedCartSyncRequest`:
  - `items`: array[SavedCartItemIn] (required)

**Responses:** 200, 422
}
